# Submodules before push

Before every `git push` in this repository:

1. Run `git submodule update --remote` so **all** submodules (`docs/gitbook`, `docs/about`) match their remotes.
2. If `docs/gitbook` advanced, run `python3 scripts/sync-gitbook-sidebar.py`.
3. Commit any updated submodule pointers and regenerated `docs/.vitepress/data/gitbook.ts` together with (or immediately before) the push.
4. Do not push while submodule refs are stale or left unstaged.

Never edit files inside submodule working trees from this repo; change content in the upstream repos, then bump pointers here.
